---
import LibraryLayout from "../../layouts/LibraryLayout.astro";
import "../../styles/section-pages.css";
---
<LibraryLayout activeSection="disclaimer" title="Health Information Disclaimer — Ridwanah" description="Important limits on Ridwanah's general health education and external health information.">
  <div id="top" class="policy-page">
    <div class="library-breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a><span>/</span><span>Health disclaimer</span></div>
    <section class="policy-hero">
      <div class="eyebrow"><span class="eyebrow-line"></span> IMPORTANT INFORMATION</div>
      <h1>Learn with care.<br /><em>Know the limits.</em></h1>
      <p>Ridwanah shares general health education. It does not provide medical care, personal diagnosis or treatment recommendations.</p>
    </section>
    <div class="policy-content">
      <section><h2>Not medical advice</h2><p>Information on Ridwanah is intended for general educational purposes. It is not a substitute for consultation, diagnosis or treatment from a qualified healthcare professional. Reading an article, watching a video or following a link does not establish a professional relationship with Ridwanah.</p></section>
      <section><h2>Not personalised to you</h2><p>Health decisions can depend on age, medical history, symptoms, pregnancy, medicines, allergies, disability and many other factors. General information cannot account for your individual situation. Speak with a qualified healthcare professional about personal symptoms, tests, medicines, vaccination schedules or treatment decisions.</p></section>
      <section><h2>Emergencies</h2><p>Do not use this website to assess or manage an emergency. If you believe someone may be experiencing a medical emergency, contact local emergency services or go to the nearest appropriate emergency facility.</p></section>
      <section><h2>Sources, videos and news</h2><p>Ridwanah provides source links so readers can check original material. External sources may change, be withdrawn or contain information that differs by location. News summaries reflect the cited publication at the date shown and should not be treated as live alerts. External video content is hosted and controlled by its publisher.</p></section>
      <section><h2>Accuracy and availability</h2><p>We aim to make content accurate and easy to understand, but cannot guarantee that every page is complete, current or suitable for every person. Guidance may change and technical interruptions may occur. Reported facts should be checked against the original source, particularly when they affect a health decision.</p></section>
      <section><h2>Medical review status</h2><p>A visible pending-review label means the content has not been approved as medically reviewed by a qualified Ridwanah reviewer. It should not be mistaken for clinical endorsement.</p></section>
      <div class="policy-actions"><a class="button button-primary" href="/health">Explore educational guides <span>↗</span></a><a class="policy-text-link" href="/editorial-policy">Read our editorial policy <span>→</span></a></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</LibraryLayout>
